        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Modeling rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Sales measures are stored at order-line grain.&lt;br&gt;2. Do not directly join the reason bridge to order-line measures for aggregation: this duplicates revenue when an order has multiple reasons.&lt;br&gt;3. Geography is role-playing: keep Ship-To and Bill-To separate.&lt;br&gt;4. Keep missing credit card references; do not discard orders.&lt;br&gt;5. Order status is retained as a fact attribute until a broader status domain is confirmed." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="200" x="1340" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
